    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Phoenix Estates are delighted to bring to the market No.5 Oakwood, Gorey, Co Wexford, Y25 XW29. This being a fine four-bedroom semi-detached residence with private parking, enclosed rear garden and one bedroom located on the ground floor. The accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room, large kitchen/diner, utility, downstairs toilet, one bedroom on the ground floor with three bedrooms, bathroom and ensuite located on the first floor."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: 3.19 x 1.95 – semi solid wooden floor, staircase to first floor.\r\n \r\nLiving room: 5.10 x 3.50 – laminated wood floor, marble fireplace with wooden surround, bay window.\r\n \r\nKitchen: 7.50 x 3.10- tiled floor, fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, integrated oven, hob, fridge-freezer and dishwasher, tiled splash back, patio door to the rear.\r\n \r\nUtility room: 1.7 x 1.61- fitted units, tiled splash back, space for washing machine and dryer, back door.\r\n \r\nW.C: 1.6 x 1.3 tiled floor, W.C, WHB\r\n \r\nBedroom 4 (downstairs): 3.18 x 2.77 – carpeted\r\n \r\nMaster Bedroom: 4.83 x 4.53 max. carpeted, bay window, built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: 2.11 x 1.55 – tiled floor, W.C, WHB, Free standing shower, tiled shower\r\n \r\nBedroom 2: 4.0 x 2.8 - laminated wood floor\r\n \r\nBedroom 3: 3.46 x 2.72 - laminated wood floor, fitted wardrobes.\r\n \r\nBathroom: 2.25 x 2.16 -bath, W.C, WHB, shower over bath, - fully tiled floors and walls.\r\n\r\nLanding: 3.20 x 2.65 – carpeted, hot press, hatch to attic.\r\n  \r\nSERVICES: \r\nPower supply, mains water, mains sewerage, oil fired central heating."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tPrivate parking\r\n•\tIdeally located within easy reach of Gorey town centre and its excellent range of amenities\r\n•\tConveniently situated just a 5-minute walk from Tesco and Gorey Shopping Centre\r\n•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\tPrivate rear patio area and garden \r\n•\tDouble-glazed PVC windows\r\n•\tSet in a quiet and established residential area"
      },
